        "date": "2026-09-16T17:15:09Z"
      },
      "message": "Update correction: surfaces are half off-scan, and oblique where on it\n\nA visual check drew one of these surfaces over an all-black slice. The\nfourteen sit on nonzero CT a median of 46% of the time; this repo's own\nCT gate measured the four published surfaces at 48-53% nonzero mid-layer\nand let them through, so its threshold was too permissive. Tested whether\nthat alone explains the obliquity: it does not. The three surfaces lying\nentirely on real CT read 49.9 / 68.2 / 71.1 deg and visibly cut across the\nsheets. Two independent reasons, and the scroll-level conclusion stays\nwithdrawn.",
