      },
      "message": "Correction: the surfaces under this negative do not follow the sheets\n\nMeasured all 14 published PHerc1447 surfaces against the team's surface\nprediction: median 61.2 deg, 0/14 within 30, against a 60 deg null. Controls\non the same instrument read 4.1-6.5 deg.\n\nThe scroll-level conclusion is withdrawn: this shows no ink was recovered\nfrom these surfaces, not that the regions lack ink. The pipeline-validation\nhalf -- CT-support gate, label-smoothing rescale, control distribution,\nconfidence-ratio test -- is unaffected.",
